  "reflectionText": "The psalmist said: he who dwells in the secret place of the Most High will rest in the shadow of the Almighty. He will cover you with his feathers. Under his wings you will take refuge. You shall not be afraid for the terror by night. What does it feel like to take refuge under wings while the terror is still passing by outside?"
